="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-27" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Project Title :</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" spc="-27" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans"/></a:rPr><a:t> Agentic Multi-LLM Validation System: Label-Free Quality Assurance for Locally Hosted Large Language Models</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-27" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Domain (Area of Project) : </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" spc="-27" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans"/></a:rPr><a:t>Artificial Intelligence, Natural Language Processing, Multi-Agent Systems, Applied Machine Learning</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="TextBox 7"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{26D17484-779C-4D25-D565-A771FEEE6A27}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="750713" y="2105279"/><a:ext cx="6141874" cy="954620"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-11" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Brief idea of Project </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" spc="-11" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans"/></a:rPr><a:t>: The system answers a question with two different local LLMs (LLaMA 3 and Mistral) and then validates the result instead of trusting it. An independent Verifier (phi3) and Judge (qwen3.5:9b) score both answers blind on an eight-factor, 80-point rubric, and semantic similarity, cross-model agreement and external Wikipedia/Wikidata checks are blended into a single 0-1 confidence score. Any answer below a data-calibrated threshold of 0.72 is regenerated automatically, and a sixth agent (Gemma 2 9B) merges the best attempt. No model both writes an answer and evaluates or merges it. Everything runs offline on local hardware with no paid APIs, validated on a self-generated 5,000-question dataset.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="just"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-5" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Screenshots of the Project / Photos of Working Model (Min.3):</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="TextBox 8"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{AE15BEC0-8AD9-2D83-68D9-00E69BEC7879}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="750713" y="3695260"/><a:ext cx="6141874" cy="1570173"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="t"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-17" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-17" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-17" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Applications :</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="172719" lvl="1" indent="-86360" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Offline, privacy-preserving question answering for institutions that cannot send data to third-party APIs.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="172719" lvl="1" indent="-86360" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Automated quality assurance and regression testing for LLM deployments - every answer ships with a calibrated confidence score.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="172719" lvl="1" indent="-86360" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="800" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>A label-free benchmark harness for comparing local models without any human-annotated ground truth.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="500" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="86359" lvl="1" algn="l"/><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="300" spc="-5" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans" panose="020B0604020202020204" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="799" b="1" spc="-17" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Public Sans Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Public Sans Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Awards/Participation if Any for TPP / Competitions / Paper Publication / Any Other Pls. Specify: --</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="172719" lvl="1" indent="-86360" algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1199"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:bu